        "Sentiment without a hook: a philosophy too abstract can't say what you sell — the aesthetic statement needs one tangible image anchor",
        "Ignoring print and seal scenes: the name lives small on product corners under repeated gaze — a form that isn't beautiful loses points with collectors by default",
        "Weird or bleak killing the gift scene: gifting is half this market — failing the \"presentable\" test forfeits it outright",
